title: mf ignore
tags: [[CLI command]] [[File tracking]]
kind: reference
summary: Named mf_ignore presets: apply/replace/remove them on a directory (default: list). The target directory is chosen with -d <path> (default: the repository root)

Applies named ignore presets to a directory's `mf_ignore` set — `-d <path>`, default the root; with no verb, lists the presets ([[Setting ignore patterns]], [[Ignore presets]]).
